Subject: [PATCH] fix for concat bool type

---
 mindspore/ccsrc/plugin/device/cpu/kernel/nnacl/kernel/concat.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mindspore/ccsrc/plugin/device/cpu/kernel/nnacl/kernel/concat.c b/mindspore/ccsrc/plugin/device/cpu/kernel/nnacl/kernel/concat.c
index dc1ebb8e..d9efab09 100644
